    <UnitTestResult executionId="30932a42-230f-4a13-b0f8-8b0fdbc93d4e" testId="86166ca1-955f-d88e-698a-6c5feb9595d8" testName="Benchmark_30kCreation_ControlVariables_WritesReport" computerName="CODESEAL" duration="00:00:00.4972020" startTime="2026-09-13T22:34:42.4311699+08:00" endTime="2026-09-13T22:34:42.9283548+08:00" testType="13cdc9d9-ddb5-4fa4-a97d-d965ccfc6d4b" outcome="Passed" testListId="8c84fa94-04c1-424b-9868-57a2d4851a1d" relativeResultsDirectory="30932a42-230f-4a13-b0f8-8b0fdbc93d4e">
      <Output>
        <StdOut># Presenter Creation Control Variables&#xD;
&#xD;
- sample size: `30000` entities&#xD;
- excludes: mesh emit, HUD projection, culling, skia, raylib&#xD;
- goal: isolate pure creation cost before touching render-path optimization&#xD;
&#xD;
## 30K Entity Only - Naive Per Entity Create&#xD;
&#xD;
- created entities: `30000`&#xD;
- total create time: `20.8216 ms`&#xD;
- per entity: `0.000694 ms`&#xD;
&#xD;
## 30K Entity Only - Bulk Allocate Only&#xD;
&#xD;
- created entities: `30000`&#xD;
- total create time: `3.9649 ms`&#xD;
- per entity: `0.000132 ms`&#xD;
&#xD;
## 30K Entity Only - Bulk Allocate + Component Set&#xD;
&#xD;
- created entities: `30000`&#xD;
- total create time: `21.1129 ms`&#xD;
- per entity: `0.000704 ms`&#xD;
&#xD;
## 30K Entity Only - Bulk Create With Shared Payload&#xD;
&#xD;
- created entities: `30000`&#xD;
- total create time: `17.2509 ms`&#xD;
- per entity: `0.000575 ms`&#xD;
- payload path uses Arch generated `Create&lt;T0..Tn&gt;(amount, ...)` overloads&#xD;
&#xD;
## 30K Entity + Presenter (No Mesh)&#xD;
&#xD;
- owners are created with the bulk allocate + component set path before timing starts&#xD;
- created owners: `30000`&#xD;
- created presenters: `30000`&#xD;
- presenter active count: `30000`&#xD;
- total create time: `388.3563 ms`&#xD;
- per owner: `0.012945 ms`&#xD;
&#xD;
## Delta&#xD;
&#xD;
- saved by bulk allocation before component writes: `16.8567 ms`&#xD;
- component write cost after bulk allocation: `17.1480 ms`&#xD;
- saved by shared payload bulk create vs naive per-entity create: `3.5707 ms`&#xD;
- presenter creation only, after owners already exist: `388.3563 ms`</StdOut>
      </Output>
